OL,3,GNEWSAFresh delay for troubled Aberdeen
OL,4,Acancer centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Aberdeen cancer centre originally
OL,7,Fmeant to open in 2020 has been further
OL,8,Fdelayed.
OL,10,FThe Anchor Cancer Centre, and Baird
OL,11,FFamily Hospital maternity facility,
OL,12,Fwere initially expected to cost up to
OL,13,F#134m, but that later rose to #438.6m.
OL,15,FEarlier this year, NHS Grampian pushed
OL,16,FAnchor's opening back to December from
OL,17,FJuly. That has now been further delayed
OL,18,Funtil May next year.
OL,20,FBaird's planned opening date remains
OL,21,FSeptember next year, but both could
OL,22,Fstill face further delays.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
